		{
			dependencies: ["4FA0AF313BCCF95C"]
			description: [
				"The &aOverworld&r is the starting point of your journey, offering a diverse environment filled with essential resources, custom biomes, and early progression opportunities. From forests and plains to oceans and cave systems, each area provides materials and challenges that form the foundation of your advancement."
				""
				"In this dimension, you will gather basic tools, secure shelter, and begin establishing your first automated setups. Explore for valuable ores, interact with unique structures, and prepare the groundwork for the complex engineering systems you will develop later."
				""
				"The Overworld serves as your primary workspace—shape it, build within it, and use it to support every stage of your progression."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/overworld_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about the Overworld in its  "
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"5DA842A1588FB8BE\" } }"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:grass_block"
