		{
			dependencies: ["391748CCFCB25D1A"]
			description: [
				"The &cNether Dimension&r is a challenging environment defined by extreme heat, hazardous terrain, and valuable resources essential for mid-game progression. Each biome introduces new mechanics, encounters, and opportunities for material gathering."
				""
				"Explore regions such as the &eCrimson Forest&r, &eBasalt Deltas&r, and &eSoul-Sand Valley&r, alongside newly introduced sub-biomes designed to expand resource variety and exploration depth. These areas contain rare materials, unique environmental hazards, and structural features that support multiple advancement paths."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lBrave the Strongholds of the Nether&r"
				"Fortress structures and bastions play a critical role in your progression. These revamped locations offer powerful loot, unique drops, and materials required for several advancement steps. Their layouts and encounters have been adjusted to encourage careful navigation, combat readiness, and strategic resource collection."
				""
				"Within these structures, you will obtain key components that support both Create-based systems and late-game dimensional progression."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPreparing for the Challenges Ahead&r"
				"Investigate the Nether’s biomes, secure specialized resources, and refine your equipment for upcoming objectives. The Nether has been redesigned as a significant mid-game milestone in &6Create - Forge Frontier&r, providing a structured progression route rather than serving as a simple transition point."
				""
				"Master the environment, gather the materials you need, and prepare for the increasingly complex challenges ahead."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/nether_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about the Nether in its  "
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"3F3994EDD215FC99\" } }"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:netherrack"
			id: "0B3F87B20695A777"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "6EA46BE59E9A7BA1"
					item: "minecraft:netherite_ingot"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "780D22E5DC99DAB3"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 25
				}
			]
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Master the remastered Nether and uncover the systems and challenges within. Click for more info!"
			tasks: [{
				dimension: "minecraft:the_nether"
				icon: "minecraft:netherrack"
				id: "34938F192D4ABC3F"
				type: "dimension"
			}]
			title: "&6Forged in Flame&r"
			x: -6.0d
