		{
			dependencies: ["0428643E0C764D8B"]
			description: [
				"Enter the &5Otherside&r, a specialized dimension introduced by the &5Deeper and Darker&r mod. Access to this realm is granted by obtaining the &eHeart of the Warden&r, making it a mid-to-late game milestone tied directly to Deep Dark progression."
				""
				"The Otherside features dark, atmospheric landscapes with bioluminescent flora, unique terrain formations, and structures guarded by advanced hostile entities. These environments contain rare materials such as &eOtherside ingots&r and other dimension-specific resources used for powerful equipment and late-game crafting."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA Realm of Shadows and Wonders&r"
				"The dimension introduces new enemies, environmental hazards, and structural challenges designed to test both combat readiness and resource management. Exploration rewards players with unique loot, materials, and progression items not found elsewhere."
				""
				"Each area encourages careful navigation and strategic decision-making as you gather resources required for further advancement."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lManaging the Challenges Ahead&r"
				"The Otherside serves as a transitional tier in your overall progression, offering access to high-value materials and crafting components. Mastering this realm requires proper preparation, upgraded equipment, and familiarity with its hostile inhabitants."
				""
				"Progress through its biomes, secure its rare resources, and prepare for the advanced technologies and exploration routes that follow."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/otherside_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about Deeper Darker in its  "
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"638EF7DB16108237\" } }"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:reinforced_deepslate"
			id: "090A156A3CB027A3"
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Conquer the mysteries of the Otherside and progress through its unique challenges. Click for more info!"
			tasks: [{
				dimension: "deeperdarker:otherside"
				icon: "minecraft:reinforced_deepslate"
				id: "09160BE9EBA13AB9"
				type: "dimension"
			}]
			title: "&6Beyond the Shadows&r"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3A09B8EFE2811CB9"]
			description: [
				"The &6Ad Astra&r planets form the core of your early and mid-game space progression. Each world introduces distinct environments, hazards, and opportunities for resource acquisition. From the cratered surface of the Moon to the harsh conditions of Venus and the mineral-rich terrain of Mars, these celestial bodies play a critical role in advancing your off-world technology."
				""
				"Exploring these planets provides access to specialized materials, progression items, and unique environmental challenges that expand your engineering and survival capabilities."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThrive Among the Stars&r"
				"Establish functional bases, gather extraterrestrial resources, and unlock systems required for sustained off-world travel. Each location requires adaptability and planning, testing your ability to manage energy, life support, and material production under different planetary conditions."
				""
				"The Ad Astra planets serve as both exploration targets and key progression steps toward more advanced rocketry and long-distance travel."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lClaim the Final Frontier&r"
				"Each rocket launch unlocks new environments and new challenges, gradually expanding your reach across the system. As you collect resources, complete objectives, and upgrade your equipment, you will gain the tools needed to push farther into the cosmos."
				""
				"Your journey through Ad Astra is designed to build technical mastery and prepare you for the increasingly complex worlds that lie ahead."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/moon_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about Ad Astra in its  "
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1523A7C10CEF69AA\" } }"
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:moon_globe"
			id: "43160A0A3268A07D"
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Explore the Ad Astra planets and progress through interplanetary exploration. Click for more info!"
			tasks: [{
				dimension: "ad_astra:moon"
				icon: "ad_astra:moon_globe"
				id: "3CEF90C695890536"
				type: "dimension"
			}]
			title: "&6Pioneers of the Cosmos&r"
			x: -3.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["58AF77D0696B9822"]
			description: [
				"The &bAlex’s Caves Planets&r introduce a set of late-game environments designed to expand your exploration and resource-gathering options. Each world combines customized surface terrain with complex subterranean biomes, providing a wide range of materials, adversaries, and discovery-focused challenges."
				""
				"These planets integrate the exotic biomes from Alex’s Caves into an interplanetary context, offering new opportunities for progression while testing your adaptability and preparedness."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPlanetary Expeditions&r"
				""
				"- &3Abyssal Chasm Planet&r: A water-dominated world where deep ocean environments house Tube Worms, Deep Ones, and the Hullbreaker—hostile lifeforms adapted to extreme depths."
				""
				"- &5Forlorn Hollows Planet&r: A desolate region defined by Guanostone formations and dangerous inhabitants such as Underzealots, Watchers, and Forsaken."
				""
				"- &2Primordial Caves Planet&r: A prehistoric biome illuminated by Ambersol, featuring creatures like Grottoceratops and Tremorsaurus in ancient cavern systems."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &dMagnetic Caves Planet&r: A landscape rich with Neodymium crystals and Galena deposits, inhabited by magnetic-based entities including Teletors and Magnetrons."
				""
				"- &2Toxic Caves Planet&r: A hazardous environment of Uranium deposits and acidic pools where mutants such as Brainiacs and Nucleepers pose significant threats."
				""
				"- &dCandy Cavity Planet&r: A deceptive world where a colorful surface conceals Licowitches and other dangerous entities within its lower layers."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lAdvancing Through Alien Frontiers&r"
				"Each planet provides specialized resources, unique conditions, and biome-specific challenges that support late-game crafting and engineering systems. Accessing these worlds requires the &6Tier 5 Rocket&r, constructed through End-level progression and advanced material processing."
				""
				"Explore these environments to gather rare materials, complete high-level objectives, and continue expanding your technological reach across the cosmos."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/alexscaves_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about Alex's Caves in its  "
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"308B363D1029D44E\" } }"
			]
			icon: "alexscaves:spelunkery_table"
			id: "2E5C57802F26496D"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "6A43BD2792147AD3"
					item: "alexscaves:raygun"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "350892F53A7E688F"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 100
				}
			]
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Explore the exotic biomes of Alex’s Caves Planets and uncover their unique resources. Click for more info!"
			tasks: [{
				dimension: "forge_frontier:abyssal_chasm"
				icon: "alexscaves:submarine"
