		{
			dependencies: ["0B3F87B20695A777"]
			description: [
				"The &6Tier 1 Rocket&r represents your initial transition from planetary exploration to space travel. As the entry point into &6Ad Astra&r progression, this vehicle enables travel to the Moon and Mars, each offering unique resources, environmental conditions, and new advancement paths."
				""
				"Constructing the Tier 1 Rocket requires gathering specialized materials, assembling precision components, and completing the first stage of space engineering. Once the rocket is fully built and positioned on the launchpad, you will be equipped to begin off-world exploration."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe First Frontier Awaits&r"
				"The Moon and Mars introduce essential mid-game materials and challenges that support the next stages of progression. Establish outposts, gather extraterrestrial resources, and begin producing the components required for higher-tier rockets."
				""
				"Progress through these early celestial bodies forms a critical foundation for deeper interplanetary travel."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPreparing for Further Exploration&r"
				"With the Tier 1 Rocket operational, you gain access to your first extraterrestrial environments and the tools necessary to expand beyond the Overworld. These early missions are designed to familiarize you with off-world hazards, energy systems, and resource chains that will become increasingly important as you advance."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/tier_1.png width:130 height:190 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about the Tier 1 Rocket in its  "
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"79B13E9FA5446394\" } }"
			]
			id: "3A09B8EFE2811CB9"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "3B173E3B8C0FFBBF"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 100
				}
				{
					id: "0269C27F500A4BAC"
