		{
			dependencies: ["43160A0A3268A07D"]
			description: [
				"Explore the &8Ancient Cities&r found deep within the &8Deep Dark&r, a dangerous region characterized by low visibility, unique mechanics, and highly lethal encounters. These structures contain valuable loot, progression items, and rare materials, but navigating them requires caution and preparation."
				""
				"Among their dangers is the &9Warden&r, a powerful entity designed to punish noise and movement. Confronting this foe is a major progression milestone and demands strategic planning, proper equipment, and advanced survival skills."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Path to the Otherside&r"
				"Defeating the Warden rewards you with the &eHeart of the Warden&r, a key item used to activate the portal leading to the &5Otherside&r dimension. This realm introduces new biomes, materials, and progression mechanics that expand your mid-to-late game objectives."
				""
				"Unlocking the Otherside marks a significant step forward, providing access to resources and systems unavailable in other dimensions."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPreparing for the Challenges Ahead&r"
				"The Deep Dark emphasizes stealth, planning, and environmental awareness. Success requires careful navigation, noise management, and a methodical approach to exploration. Overcoming its challenges prepares you for the advanced systems and hazards found within the Otherside."
				""
				"Progress through this region at your own pace, gather the materials you need, and ensure your equipment is ready for the encounter that follows."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/deepdark_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about Deeper Darker in its  "
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"638EF7DB16108237\" } }"
			]
			id: "0428643E0C764D8B"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "0367270B60DDFD03"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 100
				}
				{
					id: "54A90800581598D9"
