		{
			dependencies: ["2E5C57802F26496D"]
			description: [
				"&7The &6Forge Rocket&r stands as the ultimate achievement within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r, representing the culmination of your entire adventure.&r"
				""
				"Every machine you've built, every planet you've explored, and every challenge you've overcome has led to this moment. The Forge Rocket is not merely another spacecraft—it is the final expression of your engineering skill, industrial mastery, and technological progression."
				""
				"Constructing it requires resources, components, and knowledge gathered from every corner of the solar system."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Pinnacle of Engineering&r"
				""
				"The Forge Rocket incorporates advanced materials and technologies obtained throughout your journey. From planetary resources to complex manufacturing processes, every component demands a highly developed factory capable of operating at maximum efficiency."
				""
				"Its construction serves as the final test of your automation network, resource management, and production capabilities."
				""
				"Only the most accomplished engineers will possess the infrastructure necessary to complete it."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lWhat It Represents&r"
				""
				"The Forge Rocket is more than a vehicle."
				""
				"It is a symbol of everything you have achieved."
				""
				"* Master the production chains of the entire modpack."
				"* Gather rare resources from across the solar system."
				"* Build advanced automation systems capable of supporting massive industrial operations."
				"* Demonstrate complete mastery of exploration, engineering, and progression."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA Legacy Among the Stars&r"
				""
				"By completing the Forge Rocket, you prove that you have conquered every major challenge that &6Create - Forge Frontier&r has to offer."
				""
				"What began as a humble factory has grown into an interplanetary industrial empire spanning multiple worlds."
				""
				"The Forge Rocket is your final monument to that achievement—a testament to your creativity, perseverance, and engineering expertise."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/forge_rocket.png width:130 height:190 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about the Forge Rocket in its"
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"262FF2B00E853521\" } }"
			]
			id: "7F95771279F2C700"
			rewards: [{
				id: "5A5417D1E23C6582"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
			}]
			subtitle: "Assemble the ultimate rocket and advance toward late-game exploration. Click for more info!"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3F4794BFDCC200A7"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "ad_astra_rocketed:tier_7_rocket"
					tag: { }
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&6Forging the Final Frontier&r"
			x: 7.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&7Welcome to &6Create - Forge Frontier&r, an adventure driven by exploration, automation, and technological progression. From humble beginnings in the Overworld to the farthest reaches of the cosmos, every step of your journey will unlock new challenges, resources, and opportunities for growth.&r"
				""
				"Your path forward is not defined by a single destination, but by the worlds you discover and the machines you build along the way."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Overworld Awaits&r"
				""
				"Your adventure begins in the &aOverworld&r, a world rich with custom biomes, ancient structures, hidden secrets, and valuable resources waiting to be discovered."
				""
				"As you establish your first factory and begin mastering automation, you will uncover the relics needed to unlock &cNether Remastered&r. This reimagined dimension offers powerful resources, dangerous encounters, and critical materials required for future progression."
				""
				"Every discovery lays the foundation for greater adventures ahead."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lReaching for the Stars&r"
				""
				"The construction of your first &eTier 1 Rocket&r marks the beginning of humanity's journey beyond the Overworld."
				""
				"Through &6Ad Astra&r, you will travel across the solar system, exploring the Moon, Mars, Mercury, Venus, and Glacio. Each planet introduces unique environments, valuable resources, dangerous structures, and powerful enemies guarding the path forward."
				""
				"The further you travel from home, the greater the rewards—and the greater the challenges."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Path to The End&r"
				""
				"Your journey is about more than reaching distant planets."
				""
				"Through &5End Remastered&r, the path to The End has been transformed into a true adventure. Powerful Eyes are scattered throughout your progression, requiring exploration, boss battles, and mastery of multiple dimensions before the End Portal can finally be activated."
				""
				"Only those who prove themselves worthy will earn the right to challenge the Ender Dragon and claim victory over The End."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lBeyond the Dragon&r"
				""
				"Defeating the Ender Dragon is not the end of your journey—it is the beginning of an entirely new chapter."
				""
				"Beyond The End await six custom planets, each inspired by one of the unique cave biomes from &bAlex's Caves&r. These distant worlds feature exclusive resources, dangerous environments, powerful creatures, and progression paths unlike anything encountered before."
				""
				"From primordial wildernesses to toxic landscapes and mysterious underground civilizations, these planets represent the ultimate frontier of exploration and discovery."
				""
				"Only those who have conquered The End may venture into these uncharted realms."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lForge Your Legacy&r"
				""
				"At the culmination of your adventure lies the &6Forge Rocket&r—the ultimate symbol of your achievements."
				""
				"Constructing this legendary spacecraft requires resources, technologies, and expertise gathered from every stage of progression, including the six post-End planets. It serves as the final testament to your mastery of automation, exploration, engineering, and resource management."
				""
				"Only the most dedicated adventurers will possess the knowledge and infrastructure necessary to complete it."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&nYour journey begins now.&r"
				""
				"Explore ancient ruins."
				""
				"Conquer distant worlds."
				""
				"Master the stars."
				""
				"And forge a legacy that spans the entire cosmos."
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: "ad_astra:earth_globe"
			id: "4FA0AF313BCCF95C"
			rewards: [{
				id: "3F55AEEEC97DE53A"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 25
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 3.0d
			subtitle: "Master the dimensions, expand your reach, and push your journey forward. Click to learn more!"
			tasks: [{
				elapsedTime: 180L
				id: "3A76B17E3FB7293E"
				type: "questsadditions:time"
			}]
			title: "&6Beyond Worlds, Beyond Stars&r"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EDC9934E7D346D8"]
			description: [
				"In &cNether Remastered&r, accessing the Nether is no longer immediate. Instead, your progression begins in the &aOverworld&r, where specific structures hold the components required to unlock this dimension. These locations contain valuable relics, resources, and clues that guide you toward the next stage of advancement."
				""
				"Your objective is to explore these structures, collect the necessary materials, and assemble the items needed to prepare for entry. Once the final components are secured, you must obtain and consume the &eSeal of the Underworld&r—a specialized artifact that removes the dimensional barrier and grants access to the Nether."
				""
				"This process transforms the Nether into a true progression milestone, ensuring that your entry is earned through exploration, preparation, and deliberate advancement."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/hopoportal.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Read more about Nether Remastered in its  "
				"{ \"text\": \"dedicated quest.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"6770F96C1A4490DE\" } }"
			]
			icon: "nether_remastered:seal_of_the_underworld_item"
			id: "391748CCFCB25D1A"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "626DB3C5681FCCBC"
